<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Inventory">Inventory</span></h2>
<div class="thumb tright"><div class="thumbinner" style="width:302px;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/File%20-%20Merchant%20inventory%20item%20palette.png"><img alt="" src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/7/7a/Merchant_inventory_item_palette.png" width="300" height="144" class="thumbimage" srcset="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/7/7a/Merchant_inventory_item_palette.png 1.5x, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/7/7a/Merchant_inventory_item_palette.png 2x" /></a>  <div class="thumbcaption"><div class="magnify"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/File%20-%20Merchant%20inventory%20item%20palette.png" title="Enlarge"></a></div>Merchant inventory in "item palette" selection mode, the default</div></div></div>
<div class="thumb tright"><div class="thumbinner" style="width:302px;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/File%20-%20Merchant%20inventory%20store%20panel.png"><img alt="" src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/thumb/0/01/Merchant_inventory_store_panel.png/300px-Merchant_inventory_store_panel.png" width="300" height="144" class="thumbimage" srcset="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/thumb/0/01/Merchant_inventory_store_panel.png/450px-Merchant_inventory_store_panel.png 1.5x, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/thumb/0/01/Merchant_inventory_store_panel.png/600px-Merchant_inventory_store_panel.png 2x" /></a>  <div class="thumbcaption"><div class="magnify"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/File%20-%20Merchant%20inventory%20store%20panel.png" title="Enlarge"></a></div>Merchant inventory in "store panel" selection mode</div></div></div>
<p>The inventory <img alt="Ellipsis.png" src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/1/1c/Ellipsis.png" width="17" height="18" /> button brings up the merchant inventory selection screen. This screen is similar to the inventory screen used by the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Creature" title="Creature">creature</a> or <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Placeable" title="Placeable">placeable</a> editors, with a list of all available items that can be placed in the merchant's inventory to the left and a list of all the items currently in the merchant's inventory to the right. It defaults to the "item palette" selection mode, which shows items in the same subfolder arrangement that they appear in the resource palette. It can also be set to the "store panel" selection mode, which groups all items into the general categories that they would appear in when in the merchant's inventory. This can be useful if you've got (for example) armor items scattered through several different folders of your palette or mixed in with other item types in the same folder, but you want to pick from all available armor items to stock the merchant's inventory.
</p><p>The merchant's inventory table has the following columns:
</p>
<ul><li>Label - shows items' resource name, followed by the name shown to the player in parenthesis</li>
<li>Subgroup - <sup>[<a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Category%20-%20Articles%20with%20documentation%20requests" title="Category:Articles with documentation requests">Undocumented</a>]</sup></li>
<li>Stack size - the number of copies of this item that the merchant has.</li>
<li>Infinite - a checkbox that, when checked, gives this merchant an endless supply of this item to sell.</li></ul>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Scaling">Scaling</span></h3>
<p>Merchants are scaled when first opened, but this can easily be reset by setting MERCHANT_IS_SCALED back to 0. Check out <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/ScaleStoreItems" title="ScaleStoreItems (page does not exist)">ScaleStoreItems</a> in <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Core%20h" title="Core h">core_h</a>.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Restricted_items">Restricted items</span></h2>
<div class="thumb tright"><div class="thumbinner" style="width:302px;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/File%20-%20Merchant%20restricted%20items.png"><img alt="Merchant restricted items.png" src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/8/80/Merchant_restricted_items.png" width="300" height="196" class="thumbimage" srcset="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/8/80/Merchant_restricted_items.png 1.5x, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/8/80/Merchant_restricted_items.png 2x" /></a>  <div class="thumbcaption"><div class="magnify"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/File%20-%20Merchant%20restricted%20items.png" title="Enlarge"></a></div></div></div></div>
<p>The restricted items <img alt="Ellipsis.png" src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/1/1c/Ellipsis.png" width="17" height="18" /> button brings up this simple popup that sets which <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/BASE%20ITEM%20TYPE" title="Base item type (page does not exist)">base item types</a> the merchant will be willing to buy from the player. A list of all base item types is on the left and a list of selected types is on the right. A radio button sets whether the merchant <i>refuses</i> to buy selected item types, or <i>exclusively</i> buys selected item types.
</p>
